# 1. There is a PR diff showing one panel change in a few readable lines — not an 18k-line export churn. A reviewer can say what changed and why.
# 2. The panel's threshold binds to a named SLO constant that the alert rule ALSO imports. Grep the threshold value: it appears in exactly one source location.
# 3. Re-applying the definition from a clean checkout reproduces the dashboard exactly, in place (stable uid, no duplicates) — the round trip works.
